# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Line-ending policy (Nexus estate default)
#
# Every text file is stored LF in the index and checked out LF on every
# platform. Workflow YAML, composite action shell blocks and the scripts they
# call are executed on Linux runners, where a stray CR is a syntax error rather
# than a cosmetic difference.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz  binary
